  "title": "Light Herb Pork Loin",
  "description": "This is a light, flavorful way to prepare a pork loin, carrots, potato, and onion in a slow cooker after an overnight marination for the meat.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim Williams"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:59:35-04:00",
